  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "A moment later, Arkady's psychological scheme is set in motion. A courier arrives at the communal apartment to hand Nina Samsonova an official-looking document. Nina is shocked to learn that her husband has filed for divorce, while the formal courier insists she sign the legal receipt. Let's listen to their confrontation in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Здравствуйте, гражданка Самсонова.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Вам повестка в суд.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Господи, в какой ещё суд?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Дело гражданское. О разводе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "О каком ещё разводе?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ну, не о моём же!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ознакомьтесь и распишитесь здесь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Слушайте, это ерунда какая-то!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Не ерунда, а государственный документ!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Пожалуйста, распишитесь за получение.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Ваня совсем с ума сошёл!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Будьте любезны явиться в суд.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "В строго назначенное время!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Всего хорошего. Прощайте!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's examine the dramatic court summons delivery line by line. The courier speaks with official theatrical gravity.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Здравствуйте, гражданка Самсонова.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, citizen Samsonova.' The courier uses formal Soviet-style legal address.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Вам повестка в суд.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A court summons for you.' The dative pronoun indicates the recipient of the official notice.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Господи, в какой ещё суд?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good heavens, what court?' Nina expresses disbelief at the sudden legal document.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Дело гражданское. О разводе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A civil matter. About divorce.' The courier concisely specifies the category of lawsuit.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "О каком ещё разводе?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'About what divorce?' Nina asks with rising indignation using the prepositional case.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ну, не о моём же!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, not about mine!' The courier retorts with deadpan bureaucratic sarcasm.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ознакомьтесь и распишитесь здесь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Familiarize yourself and sign here.' Two formal imperative verbs instruct her on procedural protocol.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Слушайте, это ерунда какая-то!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Listen, this is total nonsense!' Nina dismisses the document as an absurd prank.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Не ерунда, а государственный документ!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not nonsense, but a government document!' The courier elevates the fake notice to official status.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Пожалуйста, распишитесь за получение.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please sign for the receipt.' The polite request demands legal compliance.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nina",
      "t": "Ваня совсем с ума сошёл!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Vanya has completely lost his mind!' Nina realizes that her husband is retaliating.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Будьте любезны явиться в суд.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kindly appear in court.' The courteous formula requires mandatory court attendance.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "В строго назначенное время!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'At the strictly appointed time!' The passive participle specifies the court schedule.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Всего хорошего. Прощайте!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All the best. Farewell!' The courier concludes his delivery with a melodramatic exit line. Now let's listen to the summons delivery one more time without interruption.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
